\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b0 Application Programming Interface\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}A way for two applications to communicate with each other\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Example :- swiggy wants resturant data , so now swiggy frontend sends request to backend api\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}A framework used to build http apis using asp.net core\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Returns json data\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Most asp.net core web apis are rest apis which means representational state transfer ( It use http methods & urls )\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Common http methods :- get , post , put & delete\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Endpoints means url exposed by API\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Rest API :- which are stateless , means server does not remember previous request\par

